From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuxuan Shui <yshui@codeweavers.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jan 2024 11:31:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] HACK: winegstreamer: Implement URI media source with
 uridecodebin.

This overrides Urlmon based scheme handlers. The urlmon scheme handlers
only support playback of the media after it has been fully downloaded
from the internet, and has no streaming support. This is undesirable for
games like VRChat.

Link: https://github.com/ValveSoftware/wine/pull/142
CW-Bug-Id: #20485
CW-Bug-Id: #23217
(cherry picked from commit 4d9083e70bc70efe1bc5409b8fe67f88d1f55528)
mproton-resolved: Only gst_private.h conflicted: 11.20 moved the video processor to msvproc, so video_processor_create() is gone from the context and only gstreamer_scheme_handler_create() is added. The rest applies as is on 11.20's object_context/media_source_create(). Also releases the placeholder byte stream in scheme_handler_BeginCreateObject() once the context holds it (Proton leaks one per URL).
---
 dlls/mf/mf.rgs                               |   8 -
 dlls/winegstreamer/gst_private.h             |   2 +
 dlls/winegstreamer/media_source.c            | 267 +++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/winegstreamer/mfplat.c                  |   3 +
 dlls/winegstreamer/wg_parser.c               |  14 +-
 dlls/winegstreamer/winegstreamer.rgs         |  28 ++
 dlls/winegstreamer/winegstreamer_classes.idl |   7 +
 7 files changed, 318 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

